title: Global shell › Demo menu › Open, close and what is inside
route: Every page (top bar, 'Demo' button)
intro: The Demo menu is the presenter's control panel. It is not part of the product. It moves the demo clock, jumps along a suggested path and resets the data. This diagram shows what is in it and how it closes.
dir: TD
also: There is no privacy-mode switch here: privacy mode is always on (see Settings). Escape closes this menu, like the two drawers, one layer at a time.
---
start s1 "Click 'Demo' in the top bar\n(pill shows the clock, 'Tue 10:42 am')"
overlay o1 "Demo menu opens under the button (340 px, or the window width minus a margin)\nIt scrolls inside itself when the window is short"

group gT "Section 'Time'"
  process t1 "Text: 'The demo clock is Tue Oct 20 2026, 10:42 am. It only moves when you move it.'\n(the date and time follow the clock)"
  click f1 "Click 'Fast-forward 1 hour'"
  click f2 "Click 'Fast-forward 1 day'"
  goto g1 "Continues in: Global shell › Demo menu › Fast-forward the demo clock"
endgroup

group gV "Section 'Viewing as'"
  process vt "Text: 'Access is by site (minimum necessary). Try Dr. Rivera, who sees Site A only.'"
  click fv "Click a person, for example 'Dr. Rivera'"
  goto g4 "Continues in: Global shell › Demo menu › Viewing as"
endgroup

group gP "Section 'Suggested path'"
  process sp "Seven numbered steps, 1 to 7"
  click f3 "Click a step, for example '7 Case Manager: reviews this week'"
  goto g2 "Continues in: Global shell › Demo menu › Suggested path"
endgroup

group gR "Below a divider (red text)"
  click f4 "Click 'Reset demo data'"
  goto g3 "Continues in: Global shell › Demo menu › Reset demo data"
endgroup

decision d1 "What happens to the open menu?"
process k1 "Menu stays open after a Fast-forward or a choice in 'Viewing as'\n(the pill or the tick changes, so more clicks are possible)"
process k2 "Menu closes, then the app opens the step's page"
process k3 "Menu closes, the app goes to /dashboard"
click x1 "Click anywhere outside the menu"
click x2 "Click 'Demo' again"
click x3 "Press Escape"
process k4 "Menu closes (an outside click still reaches whatever was clicked)"
process k5 "Menu closes\nThe page underneath is as it was"
end e1 "Menu is closed"

s1 --> o1
o1 --> t1 & f1 & f2 & vt & sp & f4
vt --> fv --> g4
f1 --> g1
f2 --> g1
sp --> f3 --> g2
f4 --> g3
o1 --> d1
d1 -->|After Fast-forward or Viewing as| k1
d1 -->|After a path step| k2
d1 -->|After Reset| k3
d1 -->|Mouse| x1
d1 -->|Mouse| x2
d1 -->|Keyboard| x3
x1 --> k4
x2 --> k4
x3 --> k5 --> e1
k2 --> e1
k3 --> e1
k4 --> e1
k1 -.-> o1
